{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09907","headline":"送严黄门拜御史大夫再镇蜀川兼觐省 · 岑参","name":"送严黄门拜御史大夫再镇蜀川兼觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"授钺辞金殿，承恩恋玉墀。\n登坛汉主用，讲德蜀人思。\n副相韩安国，黄门向子期。\n刀州重入梦，劒阁再题词。\n春草连青绶，晴花间赤旗。\n山莺朝送酒，江月夜供诗。\n许国分忧日，荣亲色养时。\n苍生望已久，来去不应迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}